      "message": "@jae.yoo@oss.qualcomm.com \n\nAs written in the description, you shouldn\u0027t be using doHTTPUpdate(HttpPushUri) path for BIOS update as that flow is only targeted for BMC image update (not BIOS).\n\nPlease test this flow directly via BMCWeb using Multipart form (MultipartHttpPushUri) based flow. If you find any issues via that flow, you can update this patch with the changes. In general, i am looking for a Tested section in this patch via Redfish MultipartHttpPushUri which shows the full set of logs.\n\nIf above works as expected, then you can debug from WebUI side and make any related changes there.",
